hits. Clears row + column, spawns 2 specials</span></span></li><li data-tile-type="anchor" class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-neo bg-black/25 px-2.5 py-1.5"><span class="shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center rounded-neo border-2 border-black/40 w-8 h-8 text-white" style="background: #14B8A6; box-shadow: 3px 4px 0 0 #0b1530, inset 0 3px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.55), inset 0 -6px 0 rgba(11,21,48,0.18); border: 3px solid #0B5E45;" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-anchor w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 6v16"></path><path d="m19 13 2-1a9 9 0 0 1-18 0l2 1"></path><path d="M9 11h6"></path><circle cx="12" cy="4" r="2"></circle></svg></span><span class="min-w-0"><span class="block font-neo-display font-bold text-neo-white text-sm capitalize">Anchor</span><span class="block font-neo-body text-xs text-neo-cream/70 leading-snug">Long-word bonus: +3 pts per letter in the word when cleared</span></span></li><li data-tile-type="mystery" class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-neo bg-black/25 px-2.5 py-1.5"><span class="shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center rounded-neo border-2 border-black/40 w-8 h-8 text-neo-navy" style="background: #B7A6FF; box-shadow: 3px 4px 0 0 #0b1530, inset 0 3px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.55), inset 0 -6px 0 rgba(11,21,48,0.18); border: 3px solid #4C1D95;" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span><span class="min-w-0"><span class="block font-neo-display font-bold text-neo-white text-sm capitalize">Mystery</span><span class="block font-neo-body text-xs text-neo-cream/70 leading-snug">Random surprise: score burst, spawn special, mini-pop, or mega +150</span></span></li><li data-tile-type="chocolate" class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-neo bg-black/25 px-2.5 py-1.5"><span class="shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center rounded-neo border-2 border-black/40 w-8 h-8 text-white" style="background: #3a1f0e; box-shadow: 3px 4px 0 0 #0b1530, inset 0 3px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.55), inset 0 -6px 0 rgba(11,21,48,0.18); border: 3px solid #1c0e04;" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="min-w-0"><span class="block font-neo-display font-bold text-neo-white text-sm capitalize">Chocolate</span><span class="block font-neo-body text-xs text-neo-cream/70 leading-snug">Spreads to a neighboring tile every turn. Use a chocolate tile in a word to stop it</span></span></li><li data-tile-type="cake" class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-neo bg-black/25 px-2.5 py-1.5"><span class="shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center rounded-neo border-2 border-black/40 w-8 h-8 text-white" style="background: transparent; box-shadow: 3px 4px 0 0 #0b1530, inset 0 3px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.55), inset 0 -6px 0 rgba(11,21,48,0.18); border: 3px solid #0b1530;" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="min-w-0"><span class="block font-neo-display font-bold text-neo-white text-sm capitalize">Cake</span><span class="block font-neo-body text-xs text-neo-cream/70 leading-snug">Multi-tile block with shared health. Keep hitting it to destroy it</span></span></li></ul></div></section><div data-testid="shell-mascot" aria-hidden="true" class="flex min-h-0 flex-1 items-end justify-center overflow-hidden"><img alt="" draggable="false" class="h-full max-h-52 w-auto min-h-0 object-contain mascotBob" src="/mascot/hello-nobg.webp"></div><div data-testid="shell-keys" class="mt-auto flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-[14px] border-3 border-dashed border-neo-cream/25 px-3.5 py-3 text-neo-cream/80"><p class="flex items-center gap-2 fo